OL,3,GNEWSAMan who giggled while groping girl
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who giggled while groping a young
OL,7,Fgirl has been jailed for two and a half
OL,8,Fyears.
OL,10,FAfter being caught, Filomeno Chapim, 72
OL,11,Fand from Newcastle, seemed more
OL,12,Fconcerned about breaking the rules of
OL,13,FChristianity than the impact he had on
OL,14,Fthe child, the city's crown court
OL,15,Fheard.
OL,17,FThe girl said she had been left feeling
OL,18,Fsuicidal, with Chapim's actions being
OL,19,F"unfair and disgusting", the court
OL,20,Fheard.
